  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "With a string `s`, you can transform every letter individually to be lowercase or uppercase to create another string.\n\nOutput *a list of all possible strings we could create*. Output the output in **any order**.\n\n**Example 1:**\n\n```\nInput: s = \"a1b2\"\nOutput: [\"a1b2\",\"a1B2\",\"A1b2\",\"A1B2\"]\n```\n\n**Example 2:**\n\n```\nInput: s = \"3z4\"\nOutput: [\"3z4\",\"3Z4\"]\n```\n\n**Constraints:**\n\n* `1 <= s.length <= 12`\n* `s` is composed of lowercase English letters, uppercase English letters, and digits.",
    "constraints": [
      "None"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "Single line: JSON array of all arguments, e.g. [arg1, arg2, ...]",
    "outputFormat": "Single line: JSON-serialised return value",
